1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,633
(In Korean)
Open it, Dad.

2
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:06,567
And see that she's a faker.

3
00:00:06,567 --> 00:00:13,467
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:35,167
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC SWELLS]

5
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,733
She is my daughter!

6
00:00:44,733 --> 00:00:51,200
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

7
00:00:52,133 --> 00:00:53,100
(In Korean)
What?!

8
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,067
What did you say?!

9
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,167
<i>Please send the results
to the Dynasty Hotel.</i>

10
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,200
<i> But listen.</i>

11
00:01:12,133 --> 00:01:14,233
[DANIEL]
<i> Someone is following me.</i>

12
00:01:14,233 --> 00:01:16,067
<i> Give that fake sample,</i>

13
00:01:18,533 --> 00:01:20,200
<i> but hide this real one.</i>

14
00:01:22,367 --> 00:01:24,200
<i> Guard it with your life.</i>

15
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,367
<i> I will, sir.</i>

16
00:01:25,367 --> 00:01:32,367
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

17
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,333
She attempted to hide the truth.

18
00:01:51,267 --> 00:01:54,200
I did everything I could
to stop it.

19
00:01:54,200 --> 00:02:01,200
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]
